WEBVTT

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:02.363
That in restaurants,

00:04:02.363 --> 00:04:06.075
our reason for being
is to make people feel seen.

00:04:06.659 --> 00:04:08.953
It's to make them feel welcome.

00:04:09.328 --> 00:04:11.622
It's to give them a sense of belonging.

00:04:12.164 --> 00:04:16.669
See, in restaurants, the food,
the service, the design,

00:04:16.711 --> 00:04:23.009
they're simply ingredients
in the recipe of human connection.

00:04:23.009 --> 00:04:24.802
That is hospitality.

00:04:25.344 --> 00:04:26.512
And I realized,

00:04:26.554 --> 00:04:29.807
if we could be unreasonable
in our pursuit of that,

00:04:29.849 --> 00:04:31.934
we could give people
the kind of experiences